<wxs src="/wxs/format.wxs" module="tool" />
<view class="page"><back-navbar title="{{goods.name||'原料详情'}}" avatar="/images/back.png" bindnavbuttontap="toBack"></back-navbar><view style="height:{{navBarHeight}}rpx"></view><view class="date-bar" bindtap="toDatePage"><image src="/images/calender.png"></image><text>{{hanzi}}</text><text>{{tool.transferDateString(startDate)}} - {{tool.transferDateString(stopDate)}}</text><text>›</text></view>
<view wx:if="{{hasData}}"><view class="hero"><view class="goods-head"><image wx:if="{{goods.image}}" src="{{goods.image}}" mode="aspectFill"></image><view wx:else class="placeholder">料</view><view><text class="goods-name">{{goods.name}}</text><text>所属菜品：{{dish.name}}　›</text></view><text class="tag">常用配料</text></view><view class="metrics"><view><text>配方单份标准</text><text class="green">{{goods.portion}} {{goods.portionUnit}}/份</text></view><view><text>累计理论用量</text><text>{{goods.theory}} {{goods.unit}}</text></view><view><text>制作出库分摊量</text><text class="orange">{{goods.actual}} {{goods.unit}}</text><text>较理论 {{goods.difference}} {{goods.unit}}</text></view><view><text>分摊成本</text><text class="red">¥{{goods.cost}}</text><text>占菜品成本 {{goods.costShare}}%</text></view></view></view>
<view class="section"><view class="head"><text>❗ 异常来源</text><text>从价格、用量和损耗三方面定位</text></view><view class="cause" wx:for="{{causes}}" wx:key="title"><text class="cause-icon {{item.tone}}">{{item.icon}}</text><view><text>{{item.title}}</text><text>{{item.text}}</text></view><text>{{item.value}}</text></view></view>
<view class="section"><view class="head"><text>▥　价格趋势</text><text>本期采购单价（元/{{goods.unit}}）</text></view><ec-canvas id="trendChart" canvas-id="ingredient-cost-trend" ec="{{ecTrend}}" class="chart"></ec-canvas></view>
<view class="section"><view class="head"><text>♜　关联菜品</text><text>共 {{related.length}} 个菜品使用</text></view><view class="related"><view wx:for="{{related}}" wx:key="dishId"><view class="dish-small">菜</view><view><text>{{item.dishName}}</text><text>单份用量 {{item.recipeUsagePerPortion}}{{item.gbDfgPortionUnit||goods.unit}}　分摊量 {{item.usage}}{{goods.unit}}</text></view><text>¥{{item.cost}}</text></view></view></view>
<view class="section advice"><view class="head"><text>💡 处理建议</text></view><view><text>继续观察采购价格</text><text>对比近期报价，价格异常时及时调整采购来源</text></view><view><text>核查领料与分摊</text><text>确认出库记录和实际制作数量是否一致</text></view><view><text>完善损耗记录</text><text>及时登记损耗与废弃，减少无法解释的成本偏差</text></view></view><view class="primary-btn" bindtap="showRecords">▤　查看{{goods.name}}采购记录　›</view></view><view wx:elif="{{!loading}}" class="empty">暂无该原料成本数据</view><view class="bottom"></view></view>
